  48 005523  2044          ISZ EXP         /DONE YET?
  49 005524  5315           JMP FIXLP      /NO
  50 005525  1045  FIXDNE, TAD HORD        /YES-ANSWER IN AC
  51 005526  3044          DCA EXP         /RETURN WITH ANSWER IN 44
  52 005527  5700          JMP I FFIX      /RETURN
